OL,3,ATrump hails 'historic' deal for US to
OL,4,Acontrol 65bn barrels of Venezuela's oil
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrump vowed to tap Venezuela's
OL,7,Freserves, the world's largest, after
OL,8,Fthe US captured its then-President
OL,9,FNicolas Maduro this year. More
OL,10,Frecently, Trump has been under pressure
OL,11,Fto tame domestic petrol prices, which
OL,12,Fspiked amid the Iran conflict.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/38
